  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of Commerce, National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA): National Marine Fisheries Service Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of Commerce, National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA): This project seeks to actively engage local landholders in the Western Province of the Solomon Islands in community-based projects to conserve endangered marine turtles. This project will link community-based efforts across this geography, thereby catalyzing partnerships that can deal with local economic and social challenges to sea turtle conservation. Through this program, TDA employs rangers and marine monitors to patrol and monitor Tetepares beaches and conduct scientific research and conservation programs. NOAA National Marine Fisheries Service Program through Tetepare Descendants&apos; Association.</narrative>
  </description>
